cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Silence-Aware Information-Driven Sensing: A Cost-Reliability Optimization Framework"
abstract: >
  SA-IDS is a modular PyTorch/GPyTorch framework for sparse-sensor weather-network
  experiments. It combines a sparse variational spatiotemporal Gaussian process (M1),
  sequence-aware dynamic silence diagnosis (M2), heterogeneous MNAR missingness
  modelling (M3), myopic and non-myopic active-sensing policies (M4), and graph-aware
  conformal reliability (M5) into a unified ablation-ready pipeline.
